name issue_641_outage_7s_audio_delay
describe 7 s outage with audio+video at 10 s: the audio jitter buffer stays at 300-460 ms for ~20 s afterwards (#641; yardstick for libwebrtc's side)
# Tester's repro from #641 (ours, 10 seeds @ ba3ba5a: mouth-to-ear p95 650 ms mean, 586-717). Traced in sm_compare so
# libwebrtc's per-packet, audio and bwe traces of seed 1 can be read next to ours.
duration 40s
seed 1
at 0s capacity=1500kbps delay=30ms queue=300ms
reverse at 0s delay=30ms
at 10s down
at 17s up
reverse at 10s down
reverse at 17s up
expect video.frames_rendered > 0
